WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.871
This version uses RANK instead of ROW_NUMBER If two
employees

00:00:05.897 --> 00:00:10.239
share the second-highest salary both can receive
rank two and both can pass the rank

00:00:10.253 --> 00:00:15.920
less than or equal to two condition That means the
output may contain more than

00:00:15.946 --> 00:00:21.518
two employees in a department Choose this behavior
when ties should be

00:00:21.545 --> 00:00:22.097
included
